+/*
+ * Passcode keybag (z133, iokit/Kernel/MiniAppleKeyStore.cpp): read or write len bytes at off of a file with the kernel's
+ * credentials (the caller may be SpringBoard), created root 0600, synced after a write. buf NULL: does path exist.
